==English==

===Etymology===
From stem of {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{term|expenditus|lang=la}}, irregular plural of {{term|expendo||lang=la|I weigh, I pay out}}, {{suffix||ure|gloss2=process or result}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-expenditure.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# {{context|uncountable|countable|lang=en}} Act of [[expending]] or [[paying]] out.
# {{context|uncountable|countable|lang=en}} [[amount|Amount]] [[expended]]; [[expense]]; outlay.
#: ''The '''expenditure''' of time, money, and political capital on this project has been excessive.''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|act of expending}}
* {{sense|amount expended}} [[disbursement]], [[expense]], [[payment]], [[cost]], [[charge]], [[outlay]]

